7
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,650
[7HD Channel]
♫Always making that face whenever you see me♫

8
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:17,480
[iQIYI]
♫Always making that face whenever you see me♫

9
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:18,580
♫What does that mean?♫

10
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,950
[Present]
♫What does that mean?♫

11
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:27,180
♫Whatever I say upset you, but you’ll get mad if I keep quiet♫

12
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:30,610
♫I really don’t know what to do♫

13
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:35,650
♫When deep down, I really like you♫

14
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:40,410
♫But you probably don’t care♫

15
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:43,480
♫Should I just say it out loud?♫

16
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:46,910
♫Or keep it all to myself and let it be?♫

17
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:49,310
♫What should I do?♫

18
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:54,110
♫I don’t know how to tell you how I feel♫

19
00:00:54,110 --> 00:01:00,150
♫I’m still confused by the way you react when I’m around♫

20
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:05,450
♫I’m still afraid. Will it be all right if I say it?♫

21
00:01:05,450 --> 00:01:08,550
♫So I have to hide it inside♫

22
00:01:08,550 --> 00:01:13,410
♫I don’t know what to do with these feelings♫

23
00:01:13,410 --> 00:01:19,780
♫Always keep dreaming of you, night after night♫

24
00:01:20,050 --> 00:01:24,610
♫What should I do? I can’t just let it go on like this♫

25
00:01:24,610 --> 00:01:30,710
♫But I’m too afraid to say it, so I’ll just keep it to myself♫

26
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:35,550
Flaming Chains of Love

27
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,130
[Previously]
Is there anything else you have to do today?

28
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:38,910
No, I’m taking a half day off today.

29
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:40,380
Then, let’s go find something to eat.

30
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,259
Don’t tell me you’ve been stalking me.

31
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:44,160
You seem to know her well.

32
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:47,600
Then, I guess you also know about her Phi Jah.

33
00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:48,600
Nod!

34
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,680
Who the hell is Jah?

35
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,250
What?

36
00:01:50,259 --> 00:01:53,810
If you want her to love you, you should try to pamper her.

37
00:01:53,810 --> 00:01:56,910
Take her out to nice places, and eat something delicious.

38
00:01:57,210 --> 00:01:58,910
She’ll definitely fall for you.

39
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:02,850
You’ve split up with Jee since afternoon but why are you just home now?

40
00:02:03,110 --> 00:02:06,810
If you love me, don’t ever let me down. Do you understand?

41
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:08,979
I came back this time

42
00:02:08,979 --> 00:02:11,680
because I intend to never let Phrao go again.

43
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:14,550
Thank you, Phi Jah, for taking me out today.

44
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,530
What are you doing here?

45
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:46,410
Well, I have to go to Bangkok with Dad.

46
00:02:46,930 --> 00:02:49,110
So, I won’t be able to take you out this weekend.

47
00:02:50,260 --> 00:02:51,060
Huh?

48
00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:53,500
You came here just to tell me that?

49
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:57,560
Mhm.

50
00:02:58,060 --> 00:02:59,250
I don’t want you to wait.

51
00:03:02,860 --> 00:03:03,480
Weird.

52
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,350
What’s weird?

53
00:03:05,350 --> 00:03:07,380
You’re suddenly being nice.

54
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:13,880
You hated it when I was being mean, and now you’re complaining when I’m being nice.

55
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:16,610
I’m just who I am. Aren't you used to it yet?

56
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:21,880
I am! That’s why it feels so weird when you’re being this nice.

57
00:03:25,260 --> 00:03:28,300
Look, if I finally decide to be nice to you–

58
00:03:30,860 --> 00:03:32,750
it’s you who’d be in trouble.

59
00:03:37,329 --> 00:03:41,250
Because you won’t be able to resist it, Silly Gremlin.

60
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,600
I gotta go.

61
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:58,050
Don’t forget to come to the main house to see me and Dad off.

62
00:04:09,730 --> 00:04:10,910
I've changed my mind.

63
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:14,200
Just come with me now.

64
00:04:16,060 --> 00:04:18,110
Go and wait in the car first.

65
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:32,850
Have a safe trip, Uncle.

66
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:34,750
Thanks a lot, Little One.

67
00:04:34,930 --> 00:04:36,280
I’ll leave it in your hands here.

68
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:37,450
Please don’t worry.

69
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,950
Don’t try to take over all his businesses.

70
00:04:43,530 --> 00:04:44,150
Yod.

71
00:04:44,150 --> 00:04:44,710
Yes, sir.

72
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:45,909
Look after the mine for me.

73
00:04:46,210 --> 00:04:50,350
And about the plan to explore the cave, don’t push it if it’s too dangerous.

74
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:51,400
Yes, Master.

75
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:53,380
Let’s go then.

76
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,200
Goodbye.

77
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,280
Bye, dear.

78
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:57,950
I’ll leave it to you, Yod.

79
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,100
Please let me help.

80
00:05:36,860 --> 00:05:41,180
Oh, why don’t you put them in my basket? I’ll give you a lift.

81
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:44,450
- Thank you.
- No problem.

82
00:05:52,460 --> 00:05:53,980
Are you Kaphrao?

83
00:05:56,060 --> 00:05:58,330
Yes, how do you know my name?

84
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:02,130
The Master often mentions you to me.

85
00:06:02,930 --> 00:06:05,550
I’m Wanna, his wife.

86
00:06:06,060 --> 00:06:09,610
My house is over there, at the end of the farm.

87
00:06:10,110 --> 00:06:12,900
Oh! You’re Miss Wanna.

88
00:06:20,730 --> 00:06:22,000
That’s a lot of them.

89
00:06:22,660 --> 00:06:25,010
I was going a bit too fast.

90
00:06:29,530 --> 00:06:31,310
Have some fruits first.

91
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:33,810
Come.

92
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:39,080
Wow, thank you so much. They look so tasty.

93
00:06:41,659 --> 00:06:43,460
So, do you need to rush back to work?

94
00:06:44,250 --> 00:06:46,580
No, my boss is away today.

95
00:06:46,580 --> 00:06:48,550
I can chill out all I want.

96
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,980
You mean Miss Fai?

97
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:53,110
Yes.

98
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:57,880
Ak told me that you and her often fight.

99
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:59,680
Is it getting better now?

100
00:07:01,930 --> 00:07:06,150
I’m not sure whether it’s getting better, or because I’m getting used to it.

101
00:07:10,060 --> 00:07:12,450
I feel sorry for her though.

102
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:17,680
Her mother died not even a year after giving birth to her.

103
00:07:18,100 --> 00:07:23,350
Miss Panee took her in after that, so the father and daughter have become estranged.

104
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:30,580
When she grew up, Ak started to become popular with many girls lining up for him.

105
00:07:30,910 --> 00:07:34,780
So, she misunderstood and always sees him as a womanizer.

106
00:07:35,350 --> 00:07:38,780
And thinks her father doesn’t care about her.

107
00:07:40,130 --> 00:07:41,650
When actually,

108
00:07:42,180 --> 00:07:45,110
Ak loves her very dearly.

109
00:07:45,110 --> 00:07:48,480
But you know, men–they just don’t know how to show it.

110
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,950
That’s why they end up being like this.

111
00:07:58,659 --> 00:08:00,380
Oh dear, I’m talking too much.

112
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:02,250
Not at all.

113
00:08:03,130 --> 00:08:07,930
Let’s just say, if there’s anything you need me to help; you can always tell me.

114
00:08:08,260 --> 00:08:09,800
Thank you so much.

115
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,710
I’ll finish this off then.

116
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,600
Go ahead.

117
00:08:23,700 --> 00:08:26,910
That day when Fai ditched me, she lied about having urgent matters.

118
00:08:26,910 --> 00:08:31,650
She actually went out with a girl. My friend saw them at the water park.

119
00:08:31,650 --> 00:08:33,549
Does she already have someone she likes?

120
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:36,409
Fai at the water park? Are you sure it’s her?

121
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,760
Yes, Auntie.

122
00:08:39,299 --> 00:08:42,200
But dear, your friend might have mistaken it.

123
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:46,210
No, Auntie. She sent me a picture of them too.

124
00:08:46,210 --> 00:08:47,180
Look.

125
00:08:59,330 --> 00:09:00,610
Kaphrao!

126
00:09:01,730 --> 00:09:03,130
You know her?

127
00:09:03,460 --> 00:09:04,610
Who is she?

128
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:10,380
Ah! That’s why I saw Miss Fai coming back with her the other day.

129
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:16,880
And now the workers are also talking that Miss Fai often spends a lot of time with that dirty rat.

130
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,710
That they often go out together.

131
00:09:22,460 --> 00:09:24,660
You have to do something about this, Auntie!

132
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:43,710
Geez, Miss Phrao.

133
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:45,950
It’s a day-off but you’re still working, huh?

134
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,050
Aren’t you going to leave it for someone else too?

135
00:09:48,660 --> 00:09:51,280
Well, I have nothing to do.

136
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,950
It’s so boring.

137
00:09:53,160 --> 00:10:00,050
Aww, is it because Miss Fai is away? You miss her, don’t you?

138
00:10:00,060 --> 00:10:01,110
Nonsense!

139
00:10:01,110 --> 00:10:05,710
I’m actually relieved. No one's here to keep bothering me.

140
00:10:05,980 --> 00:10:07,000
Chill!

141
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,530
- Chill?
- Yeah.

142
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,800
Miss Kaphrao!

143
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:20,530
Miss Panee wants to see you now.

144
00:10:24,660 --> 00:10:25,510
Right now?

145
00:10:25,510 --> 00:10:26,510
Yeah.

146
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:30,380
Don't you understand the word ‘NOW’?

147
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:37,180
Fine! I’ll be right there. Right NOW!

148
00:10:37,730 --> 00:10:39,210
Geez, whatever!

149
00:10:39,460 --> 00:10:41,880
Holy shit!

150
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:43,880
Freaking slippery!

151
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:46,710
Hurry up! Don’t be late!

152
00:10:51,300 --> 00:10:53,460
Why would Miss Panee want to see you?

153
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:55,950
I don’t trust her at all.

154
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:02,530
[Panee]: I want to see you because I need you to do something for me.

155
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:08,880
Of course, what is it?

156
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:14,450
My friend is here with her daughter.

157
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:16,500
So, I want to take them to see the cave in the mine.

158
00:11:17,260 --> 00:11:19,160
I heard the workers say they've just discovered it.

159
00:11:21,060 --> 00:11:22,510
You want to go to that cave?

160
00:11:22,510 --> 00:11:25,050
Yes, why?

161
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:31,810
It's only been found recently. The workers barely get to explore it yet.

162
00:11:31,810 --> 00:11:34,850
Maybe we should wait for the officials to explore it first.

163
00:11:34,850 --> 00:11:36,210
I’m afraid it might be too dangerous.

164
00:11:36,260 --> 00:11:37,410
Why would it be dangerous?

165
00:11:37,750 --> 00:11:42,510
I heard Ak plans to make it a tourist attraction. I want to go there.

166
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:46,210
And you must be the one to take us there.

167
00:11:54,100 --> 00:11:55,900
When do you want to go then?

168
00:11:57,330 --> 00:11:58,130
Tomorrow.

169
00:12:00,300 --> 00:12:03,180
But I'd need some time to prepare the place and make sure it's safe.

170
00:12:03,260 --> 00:12:04,550
I’m afraid I won't be able to get everything done by–

171
00:12:04,700 --> 00:12:08,010
I said tomorrow! You must do as I say.

172
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:10,880
And don't you dare make any mistake!

173
00:12:27,260 --> 00:12:32,610
Auntie, I really don't get it. Why do we have to go see that stupid cave?

174
00:12:32,610 --> 00:12:35,950
It’s dark and musty, and extremely hot in there.

175
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:38,710
Listen, I've done some digging up, Miss.

176
00:12:39,010 --> 00:12:42,350
That Kaphrao rat is scared of the dark and narrow space.

177
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:49,410
I’ll make her hate it here and leave this place herself.

178
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:54,110
I’ll help you, Auntie.

179
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:08,780
Miss Panee wants me to take her friends to see the cave in an old mine tomorrow.

180
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:13,480
I’d like to ask for your advice on which part of the cave I could show them around.

181
00:13:14,130 --> 00:13:16,110
You’re going to that cave in the mine?

182
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:17,210
Yes.

183
00:13:17,210 --> 00:13:20,650
But it’s not safe to go in yet. It’ll be too dangerous.

184
00:13:20,650 --> 00:13:23,210
Although the Master plans to make it a tourist attraction,

185
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:26,610
we still need the officials to approve of its safety first.

186
00:13:27,150 --> 00:13:31,480
Why don’t you take them somewhere else instead?

187
00:13:33,460 --> 00:13:35,300
But Miss Panee insists she wants to go there.

188
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:39,550
I guess I’ll have to do it.

189
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:44,760
Miss Panee wants Kaphrao to take her friends to see the cave?

190
00:13:45,160 --> 00:13:46,910
Yes, Miss Phrao has no choice but to comply.

191
00:13:46,910 --> 00:13:50,950
She doesn’t want to be in trouble so she said she’d do it.

192
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:54,250
Ak and Miss Fai are away now. What should we do?

193
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:57,180
That’s why I’m calling you, Miss Wanna.

194
00:13:57,180 --> 00:14:01,000
I’d like you to help talk to Miss Panee.

195
00:14:06,900 --> 00:14:10,550
She could barely stand the sight of me. I don’t know if she’ll even listen.

196
00:14:17,100 --> 00:14:18,850
But I’ll give it a try.

197
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,960
Who allows you to enter my house?

198
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:33,650
I heard you've asked Kaphrao to take your friends to see the cave in an old mine.

199
00:14:33,730 --> 00:14:36,050
It's probably too dangerous.

200
00:14:36,300 --> 00:14:38,350
Why don't you go somewhere else instead? Let me–

201
00:14:38,350 --> 00:14:40,550
It’s none of your concern where I’ll take my friends to.

202
00:14:41,300 --> 00:14:43,180
Who are you to interfere?

203
00:14:46,130 --> 00:14:48,710
I’m worried about everyone’s safety.

204
00:14:48,710 --> 00:14:50,680
If you don’t mind, please let me help.

205
00:14:50,710 --> 00:14:54,810
No need. You’re just a lowly mistress Ak’s been keeping at the back of the farm.

206
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:58,480
Don’t think so highly of yourself and try to mess with my business.

207
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:01,880
You’d better know your place.

208
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:20,750
Miss Panee didn’t listen to me at all. She’s so stubborn.

209
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:24,480
What should we do then?

210
00:15:25,050 --> 00:15:26,910
I still can’t get a hold of Master.

211
00:15:27,500 --> 00:15:29,380
There’s nothing we could do now.

212
00:15:30,150 --> 00:15:32,880
Please look out for Kaphrao, Yod.

213
00:15:32,930 --> 00:15:33,730
Yes, Miss.

214
00:16:13,260 --> 00:16:14,800
Hey, I need to get out too.

215
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,350
Just a moment.

216
00:16:24,750 --> 00:16:25,810
This way, please.

217
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,350
Do you need me to help?

218
00:16:32,060 --> 00:16:33,910
I have legs, I can walk.

219
00:16:39,130 --> 00:16:39,930
Hello.

220
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:40,800
Hello.

221
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:51,250
This is Yod, Uncle Akanee’s assistant. He’ll help take care of us while we’re in the cave.

222
00:16:52,260 --> 00:16:53,060
Hello, Miss.

223
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:01,110
Let me tell you a bit about this place.

224
00:17:01,510 --> 00:17:06,980
This is a natural cave, found during the tunnel excavation.

225
00:17:06,980 --> 00:17:09,050
It’s considered a medium-size cave.

226
00:17:09,300 --> 00:17:16,010
From what the workers have explored so far, the inside is quite big and naturally divided into many rooms.

227
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:17,849
As for the weather inside–

228
00:17:17,849 --> 00:17:18,410
Hot!

229
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:20,910
It’s so hot! And dusty too!

230
00:17:21,760 --> 00:17:23,849
Look, give me some iced coffee.

231
00:17:23,849 --> 00:17:25,880
I want it cold-brewed.

232
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:28,280
Coffee? We don’t have it here.

233
00:17:28,560 --> 00:17:30,280
Go find it then.

234
00:17:31,530 --> 00:17:34,000
My friend wants it. Don’t be rude.

235
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:37,950
For me, I’ll have premium matcha from Uji town.

236
00:17:37,950 --> 00:17:40,110
With oat milk. And make sure it’s less sweet.

237
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:44,210
If you want that, it’ll take hours to get them just by car.

238
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:46,980
We can wait. Hurry up and take care of it.

239
00:17:51,650 --> 00:17:52,780
Yes.

240
00:18:07,500 --> 00:18:08,500
Here are your drinks.

241
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,400
This one is a cold-brew.

242
00:18:18,460 --> 00:18:22,850
And here’s your premium matcha from Uji with oat milk and less sweet.

243
00:18:23,010 --> 00:18:24,310
Thanks.

244
00:18:25,530 --> 00:18:29,060
Where do you think you’re going? Unwrap the straw for me too.

245
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:31,060
Yes.

246
00:18:38,730 --> 00:18:39,810
So pretty.

247
00:18:40,760 --> 00:18:43,880
Now that you have your drinks, should we start moving and go inside?

248
00:18:44,180 --> 00:18:45,750
Before it’d get too dark.

249
00:18:46,360 --> 00:18:49,780
I’ve just sat down and barely had a sip.

250
00:18:49,930 --> 00:18:53,910
Yeah, I also need 30 more minutes to do some touch-up on my makeup.

251
00:18:58,950 --> 00:19:01,080
[Jirapa]: Do you think I should add more lipstick?

252
00:19:01,130 --> 00:19:03,480
[Panee]: Just enjoy your mother-and-daughter time.

253
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:08,910
Here’s your torch.

254
00:19:11,500 --> 00:19:12,650
A torch.

255
00:19:14,500 --> 00:19:15,300
Here.

256
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:20,610
Please make sure you have your belongings with you.

257
00:19:20,950 --> 00:19:24,610
There’s a stairs to go down but it’ll be quite steep.

258
00:19:24,610 --> 00:19:28,210
Please don’t take pictures on your way down to prevent any accident.

259
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:31,950
That’s right. Since down there is quite dark and narrow,

260
00:19:32,150 --> 00:19:34,410
I’ll be your guide from this point onwards.

261
00:19:34,410 --> 00:19:38,980
Miss Kaphrao will be waiting here to coordinate with other workers for a safety purpose.

262
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:40,150
No.

263
00:19:41,550 --> 00:19:44,880
Kaphrao must be the one to take us inside.

264
00:19:45,130 --> 00:19:47,150
But she has never gone in there before.

265
00:19:47,150 --> 00:19:49,450
I’ll feel safer if she goes with us.

266
00:19:50,730 --> 00:19:51,350
That’s right.

267
00:19:51,650 --> 00:19:54,280
And I’ll also have someone my age to talk to.

268
00:19:59,530 --> 00:20:00,330
So?

269
00:20:07,700 --> 00:20:10,930
Sure. If you’re ready, let’s go then.

270
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:26,710
Let’s go.

271
00:20:33,900 --> 00:20:34,760
[Kaphrao]: Be careful.

272
00:20:35,930 --> 00:20:36,760
[Panee]: I know.

273
00:20:46,730 --> 00:20:48,350
Hey, not so fast.

274
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:56,650
Please be careful, the floor is quite slippery.

275
00:20:56,650 --> 00:20:59,950
If anyone finds it difficult to breathe, let me know right away.

276
00:21:00,130 --> 00:21:02,180
Enough with the talking. Just walk.

277
00:21:02,700 --> 00:21:03,500
Yes.

278
00:21:07,500 --> 00:21:09,760
Hey, why didn’t you tell me the floor is uneven there?

279
00:21:09,850 --> 00:21:11,010
I’m sorry.

280
00:21:12,810 --> 00:21:14,660
Seriously, you’re the worst guide ever.

281
00:21:21,300 --> 00:21:24,150
This cave used to be an underground waterway.

282
00:21:24,150 --> 00:21:27,130
After years of erosion, it became the walkway we’re standing on right now.

283
00:21:28,860 --> 00:21:34,650
If you look at the wall carefully, you’ll see traces of flowstone or layers of sediment formed on a cave wall.

284
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:46,710
Do you see the drawing of elephants over there?

285
00:21:49,130 --> 00:21:52,260
People believe it’s a baby elephant trotting after its mother.

286
00:21:52,460 --> 00:21:53,610
It’s that way.

287
00:22:04,800 --> 00:22:06,380
There’s nothing interesting here.

288
00:22:08,160 --> 00:22:10,050
There’s probably more to see inside.

289
00:22:10,160 --> 00:22:11,710
Can you take us there?

290
00:22:23,300 --> 00:22:24,100
Yes.

291
00:22:58,000 --> 00:23:00,060
Geez, can you go faster?

292
00:23:01,450 --> 00:23:03,900
It’s bad for the elders to have their backs bent like this.

293
00:23:12,760 --> 00:23:13,560
Move it.

294
00:23:27,900 --> 00:23:30,610
Hey, slow down.

295
00:23:31,780 --> 00:23:34,680
Can’t you see Jinda couldn’t catch up?

296
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:39,150
I’m sorry.

297
00:23:39,560 --> 00:23:43,450
I just want to take you to see the interesting part as fast as I can.

298
00:23:43,560 --> 00:23:46,480
But I want to spend ten more minutes here to take in the moment.

299
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:48,500
This spot is pretty too, Mum.

300
00:23:48,660 --> 00:23:50,580
Let's take a picture?

301
00:23:50,580 --> 00:23:51,780
Yes.

302
00:24:04,260 --> 00:24:07,650
Yes.

303
00:24:08,700 --> 00:24:10,750
Why is it so hot outside?

304
00:24:11,730 --> 00:24:13,080
Can you please hurry up a bit?

305
00:24:13,110 --> 00:24:17,780
Hey, when will the van arrive? I’m dying to go home.

306
00:24:18,130 --> 00:24:20,580
Please wait a moment. The driver has gone to the toilet.

307
00:24:20,800 --> 00:24:23,450
Oh my goodness, why now?

308
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:37,750
Oh no, Mum!

309
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:40,330
What’s the matter, dear?

310
00:24:40,730 --> 00:24:43,550
My ring! My diamond ring is gone.

311
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:45,480
Oh dear, what to do?

312
00:24:45,600 --> 00:24:47,160
I’ll have someone look for it, Miss.

313
00:24:47,180 --> 00:24:50,180
No! I don’t trust the workers here.

314
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:52,810
What if they keep it to themselves when they find it.

315
00:24:52,860 --> 00:24:54,810
That ring is so expensive.

316
00:24:59,930 --> 00:25:03,800
This is your fault. You need to go get the ring for her.

317
00:25:05,300 --> 00:25:06,850
- But–
- No but!

318
00:25:07,380 --> 00:25:11,410
If you can’t find it, you’re the one to be blamed. Go find it!

319
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:14,280
As for you, take me and my friends home.

320
00:25:14,280 --> 00:25:16,110
I’m not going to wait for that damn van.

321
00:25:26,600 --> 00:25:27,950
- Miss Phrao
- Yes?

322
00:25:27,950 --> 00:25:31,080
I can ask the workers here to help look for it.

323
00:25:34,300 --> 00:25:35,560
It’s okay, Uncle Yod.

324
00:25:35,860 --> 00:25:39,850
Miss Panee wants to blame it on me so I must go look for it myself.

325
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:42,400
But I thought you’re afraid of the dark and narrow space.

326
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:54,280
It’s all right. There are some lights in there so it’s not that dark.

327
00:25:58,160 --> 00:26:01,910
Then, please make it quick. Don’t stay there long, Miss.

328
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:03,810
Don’t worry.

329
00:26:04,450 --> 00:26:06,280
You go on and drop them home.

330
00:26:06,280 --> 00:26:08,080
I can get someone here to take me back.

331
00:28:21,900 --> 00:28:23,180
Help…

332
00:28:26,300 --> 00:28:27,550
Help me.

333
00:28:30,900 --> 00:28:31,700
Help me.

334
00:28:33,480 --> 00:28:34,300
Help me.

335
00:28:42,700 --> 00:28:44,010
Help me.

336
00:28:44,360 --> 00:28:45,550
Please help me!

337
00:28:50,010 --> 00:28:51,410
Help…

338
00:28:55,200 --> 00:28:56,000
Kaphrao!

339
00:28:58,930 --> 00:28:59,850
Kaphrao!

340
00:29:00,650 --> 00:29:01,580
Kaphrao!

341
00:29:02,210 --> 00:29:03,280
Kaphrao!

342
00:29:04,080 --> 00:29:05,180
Kaphrao!

343
00:29:06,350 --> 00:29:07,410
Kaphrao!

344
00:29:10,010 --> 00:29:11,110
Kaphrao!

345
00:29:14,250 --> 00:29:15,310
Kaphrao!

346
00:29:17,150 --> 00:29:18,410
Kaphrao!

347
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:02,250
It’s me.

348
00:30:03,910 --> 00:30:05,550
Fai.

349
00:30:05,550 --> 00:30:08,880
Calm down. Take a deep breath.

350
00:30:47,500 --> 00:30:49,080
How did you get here?

351
00:30:50,800 --> 00:30:54,010
Miss Wanna couldn’t contact Dad so she called me instead.

352
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:59,450
I rushed back the minute I knew what my aunt did to you.

353
00:31:04,130 --> 00:31:05,580
I’m worried about you.

354
00:31:17,930 --> 00:31:18,960
I’m sorry.

355
00:31:23,730 --> 00:31:26,050
It’s me who got you into this mess.

356
00:31:28,260 --> 00:31:30,150
Let’s get out of here.

357
00:31:30,400 --> 00:31:32,660
It was about to rain when I came in.

358
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:34,850
Or else it'll be too difficult to get out.

359
00:31:35,580 --> 00:31:36,480
Mhm.

360
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:46,150
Watch your head.

361
00:32:12,460 --> 00:32:13,610
Thank you.

362
00:33:03,130 --> 00:33:05,910
What? A landslide at the cave?

363
00:33:06,060 --> 00:33:08,750
Yes, Master. Miss Phrao and Young Master are still in the cave.

364
00:33:09,010 --> 00:33:10,810
I’m waiting for the rescue team right now.

365
00:33:10,860 --> 00:33:12,660
I’m on my way. Hold it down until I get there.

366
00:33:14,330 --> 00:33:16,610
Holy shit! Miss Nee!

367
00:33:17,130 --> 00:33:20,850
There’s a landslide at the cave! A complete chaos!

368
00:33:21,360 --> 00:33:23,850
What about that girl? Did she get out of there in time?

369
00:33:23,900 --> 00:33:25,810
No, no! But…

370
00:33:25,810 --> 00:33:26,610
But what?

371
00:33:26,610 --> 00:33:28,750
But Miss Fai also went into the cave!

372
00:33:29,300 --> 00:33:30,910
How the hell did she get there?

373
00:33:31,500 --> 00:33:33,750
She went to look for that girl at the mine.

374
00:33:33,750 --> 00:33:37,750
When she knew that little rat was still in the cave, she went to look for her there.

375
00:33:50,900 --> 00:33:53,450
It’s raining so hard the soil couldn’t hold water and collapsed.

376
00:33:54,730 --> 00:33:57,450
I don’t care if you’ll dig a hole or blow it up.

377
00:33:57,450 --> 00:34:00,250
You have to get my daughter and my niece out of there!

378
00:34:00,260 --> 00:34:01,060
Yes, sir!

379
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,900
Fai! Fai!

380
00:34:13,980 --> 00:34:15,010
You can’t go in there.

381
00:34:15,199 --> 00:34:17,780
Let me go! I have to help my niece!

382
00:34:17,780 --> 00:34:19,250
But it might collapse again.

383
00:34:19,250 --> 00:34:20,409
Let me go!

384
00:34:20,480 --> 00:34:23,150
Don’t just stand here. Go in there and help her!

385
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:25,010
We’re working on it, Miss.

386
00:34:27,159 --> 00:34:30,480
Ak! Ak! You have to help Fai!

387
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:31,949
You have to help her!

388
00:34:32,530 --> 00:34:34,510
This is all your damn fault!

389
00:34:34,510 --> 00:34:39,480
They already warned you it’d be dangerous but you chose to listen to your stupid ego and forced Kaphrao to go in there!

390
00:34:39,480 --> 00:34:43,150
And look what happened! Your niece has to pay for what you did! Serve you right!

391
00:34:44,710 --> 00:34:45,600
Bloody hell!

392
00:34:45,860 --> 00:34:48,449
I had no idea Fai would go in there!

393
00:34:52,400 --> 00:34:53,310
Kaphrao.

394
00:34:54,409 --> 00:34:56,150
Fai!

395
00:34:56,679 --> 00:34:58,350
My dear Fai!

396
00:34:59,580 --> 00:35:01,280
Fai!

397
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:06,510
Get off me! Go and help them!

398
00:35:25,260 --> 00:35:27,300
We’re not going to die here, are we?

399
00:35:28,600 --> 00:35:29,760
Of course not.

400
00:35:30,530 --> 00:35:32,560
I remember there's also another way out.

401
00:35:34,400 --> 00:35:36,130
We'll definitely make it out of here, Guinea Pig.

402
00:35:59,600 --> 00:36:01,300
Why didn’t you look where you’re going?

403
00:36:02,600 --> 00:36:06,100
You kept swinging the torch everywhere. I couldn't see properly.

404
00:36:11,260 --> 00:36:12,760
Does it hurt a lot? Can you walk?

405
00:36:23,260 --> 00:36:24,060
Hop on.

406
00:36:24,380 --> 00:36:26,810
What? But…

407
00:36:26,810 --> 00:36:29,250
But what? Just get on my back.

408
00:36:29,500 --> 00:36:32,880
If it collapses again, we'll definitely be dead.

409
00:36:39,500 --> 00:36:40,780
Hold the torch for me.

410
00:37:33,160 --> 00:37:34,880
Did you find it?

411
00:37:36,660 --> 00:37:37,460
So?

412
00:37:40,700 --> 00:37:42,060
It also got blocked.

413
00:37:42,380 --> 00:37:47,580
What? So, we’re really going to die here?

414
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:54,930
We’re not gonna die here.

415
00:37:56,200 --> 00:37:58,460
Trust me, everyone is doing all they can to get us out.

416
00:38:01,130 --> 00:38:02,480
We just have to wait.

417
00:38:21,560 --> 00:38:23,610
But you're not here alone.

418
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:33,650
I promise I'll keep you safe.

419
00:39:18,160 --> 00:39:18,960
Are you cold?

420
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:23,650
Just a little.

421
00:40:18,560 --> 00:40:20,360
I just don't want to see you die.

422
00:40:21,700 --> 00:40:23,300
Otherwise, Dad would blame me again.

423
00:40:58,530 --> 00:41:00,130
You know what, Guinea Pig?

424
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:10,330
I actually don't hate it when you're around.

425
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:19,210
I think…

426
00:41:24,260 --> 00:41:26,150
I'm starting to like you now.

427
00:41:57,800 --> 00:41:58,600
Kaphrao.

428
00:42:03,800 --> 00:42:04,600
Kaphrao!

429
00:42:08,300 --> 00:42:09,100
Kaphrao!

430
00:42:10,760 --> 00:42:11,560
Kaphrao!

431
00:42:12,500 --> 00:42:13,300
Kaphrao!

432
00:42:15,960 --> 00:42:16,760
Kaphrao!

433
00:42:18,460 --> 00:42:19,260
Kaphrao!

434
00:42:22,360 --> 00:42:23,160
Kaphrao!

435
00:42:24,530 --> 00:42:25,330
Kaphrao!

436
00:42:27,000 --> 00:42:27,800
Phrao!

437
00:42:58,560 --> 00:43:07,180
Phrao, how are you feeling?

438
00:43:08,860 --> 00:43:09,660
Nod,

439
00:43:11,600 --> 00:43:13,300
Why am I here?

440
00:43:15,700 --> 00:43:17,980
It’s the rescue team.

441
00:43:18,060 --> 00:43:20,400
They found you and Miss Fai unconscious in the cave.

442
00:43:24,400 --> 00:43:25,600
What about Fai?

443
00:43:28,500 --> 00:43:30,110
Is she okay?

444
00:43:30,700 --> 00:43:32,380
Where is she right now?

445
00:43:48,730 --> 00:43:49,610
Fai.

446
00:43:49,980 --> 00:43:51,180
My dear.

447
00:43:53,500 --> 00:43:54,500
Where’s Kaphrao?

448
00:43:56,200 --> 00:43:58,800
She’s safe. She’s resting in the other room.

449
00:44:01,400 --> 00:44:02,850
Worry about yourself first.

450
00:44:03,660 --> 00:44:06,330
You almost died because of that girl.

451
00:44:07,760 --> 00:44:10,060
Why did you follow her into the cave?

452
00:44:10,200 --> 00:44:12,380
I already told you she’s a bloody jinx!

453
00:44:12,380 --> 00:44:13,130
Panee.

454
00:44:19,100 --> 00:44:21,080
You also know it’s dangerous.

455
00:44:23,730 --> 00:44:26,180
Why did you tell her to go in there?

456
00:44:32,360 --> 00:44:33,160
I…

457
00:44:35,960 --> 00:44:37,810
I’m okay now.

458
00:44:38,250 --> 00:44:39,810
I want to see Kaphrao.

459
00:44:41,300 --> 00:44:42,100
Sure.

460
00:45:09,900 --> 00:45:11,210
[Nod]: Drink slowly.

461
00:45:14,560 --> 00:45:15,360
Thank you.

462
00:45:23,160 --> 00:45:23,960
Phrao,

463
00:45:26,160 --> 00:45:28,360
come work with me in Bangkok.

464
00:45:29,900 --> 00:45:31,180
Can’t you see

465
00:45:32,530 --> 00:45:34,360
how horrible people here treat you?

466
00:45:36,260 --> 00:45:38,010
They don't like you.

467
00:45:45,100 --> 00:45:48,750
I know, but I still want to be here.

468
00:45:49,800 --> 00:45:50,600
Why?

469
00:45:52,500 --> 00:45:56,810
Just come with me. I promise I’ll take good care of you.

470
00:45:58,600 --> 00:46:00,000
I really appreciate it, Nod.

471
00:46:00,860 --> 00:46:02,160
But I’ll be all right.

472
00:46:07,000 --> 00:46:08,450
Can’t you hear it?

473
00:46:09,330 --> 00:46:11,680
She said she wants to be here.

474
00:46:17,560 --> 00:46:20,950
Guinea Pig, how are you feeling?

475
00:46:22,500 --> 00:46:23,750
I’m fine.

476
00:46:29,460 --> 00:46:31,210
Just leave if you’re done.

477
00:46:32,330 --> 00:46:34,060
She’s in good hands now.

478
00:46:39,900 --> 00:46:44,380
I’m leaving then, Phrao. I’ll drop by your place later.

479
00:47:08,660 --> 00:47:10,380
How’s your ankle?

480
00:47:11,260 --> 00:47:12,700
Just a bit sprained.

481
00:47:13,360 --> 00:47:14,850
It’s getting much better now.

482
00:47:15,400 --> 00:47:17,550
The doctor said I can go home tomorrow.

483
00:47:24,500 --> 00:47:28,900
Isn't Nod your close friend? Why didn't you accept her offer and move to Bangkok to stay with her?

484
00:47:36,330 --> 00:47:37,130
Well,

485
00:47:38,200 --> 00:47:39,000
I…

486
00:47:40,800 --> 00:47:41,600
I…

487
00:47:43,100 --> 00:47:43,900
You what?

488
00:47:44,530 --> 00:47:45,760
I’m worried about Uncle.

489
00:47:45,800 --> 00:47:47,550
I’m not leaving unless he wants me to.

490
00:47:59,060 --> 00:47:59,860
Hey.

491
00:48:00,460 --> 00:48:01,280
What?

492
00:48:01,280 --> 00:48:03,110
I’m here to visit you, don’t sleep yet.

493
00:48:03,700 --> 00:48:05,210
But I need to rest.

494
00:48:13,200 --> 00:48:16,180
Then, get lots of rest.

495
00:48:21,860 --> 00:48:23,150
I thought you said you’d rest.

496
00:48:23,160 --> 00:48:24,910
How could I sleep if you keep staring?

497
00:48:25,130 --> 00:48:26,510
Just close your eyes.

498
00:48:26,700 --> 00:48:28,130
Why don’t you get some rest too?

499
00:48:28,300 --> 00:48:29,380
But I want to stay here.

500
00:48:48,000 --> 00:48:48,800
Thank you.

501
00:48:53,130 --> 00:48:54,800
Now that the storm has passed.

502
00:48:55,900 --> 00:48:58,000
And Miss Fai and Kaphrao are both safe.

503
00:48:59,300 --> 00:49:01,200
What is it that’s still bothering your mind?

504
00:49:03,000 --> 00:49:04,130
I'm worried about Kaphrao.

505
00:49:10,000 --> 00:49:14,280
Well, you should be. This time, even Miss Fai almost got hurt.

506
00:49:14,980 --> 00:49:17,310
I’m sure Miss Panee will not stop at this.

507
00:49:19,760 --> 00:49:26,410
I think it’s time for me to do something to protect Kaphrao.

508
00:49:46,100 --> 00:49:49,850
From now on, you must treat Kaphrao

509
00:49:52,100 --> 00:49:54,810
as if she were my own daughter.

510
00:49:59,960 --> 00:50:04,550
I want you all to look after her, and treat her just like how treat Fai.

511
00:50:04,550 --> 00:50:06,550
You must always keep her safe.

512
00:50:07,450 --> 00:50:12,650
Those who are rude to her, bully her, or cause her any trouble

513
00:50:13,900 --> 00:50:16,310
will be considered as my enemy!

514
00:50:16,560 --> 00:50:18,310
What’s going on here, Uncle?

515
00:50:18,930 --> 00:50:22,010
I’m not going to let something like that cave incident happen again.

516
00:50:22,760 --> 00:50:24,060
So, from now on,

517
00:50:24,760 --> 00:50:27,250
you must move to live with me at the main house.

518
00:50:27,560 --> 00:50:28,360
What?

519
00:50:41,260 --> 00:50:43,110
Did you hear what the Master said this morning?

520
00:50:43,110 --> 00:50:45,910
Why does he care about Kaphrao so much?

521
00:50:46,200 --> 00:50:49,360
Or is she really his daughter?

522
00:50:50,100 --> 00:50:53,080
Could be. He practically raised her up and paid for everything.

523
00:50:53,380 --> 00:50:56,080
Or is she the daughter of his mistress?

524
00:50:56,300 --> 00:50:57,260
Yeah, possible.

525
00:51:05,060 --> 00:51:09,710
What? The workers think I’m his secret daughter?

526
00:51:09,730 --> 00:51:10,530
Yes.

527
00:51:12,160 --> 00:51:13,700
Last time they thought I was his kept woman.

528
00:51:14,160 --> 00:51:16,310
Now, they’re saying I’m his daughter?

529
00:51:16,560 --> 00:51:18,600
It’s quite possible though.

530
00:51:18,960 --> 00:51:19,710
Wait!

531
00:51:19,710 --> 00:51:22,410
Don’t tell me it's true?

532
00:51:22,730 --> 00:51:24,410
Hey, I have a father too.

533
00:51:24,410 --> 00:51:26,280
How could I be his daughter?

534
00:51:26,450 --> 00:51:31,480
Aww, Miss Phrao. Please don’t be so fast to turn down a chance to become rich.

535
00:51:31,660 --> 00:51:34,330
I honestly think it’s a blessing to be his daughter.

536
00:51:34,530 --> 00:51:37,150
He’s rich and handsome.

537
00:51:37,360 --> 00:51:41,210
And you’ll also get to have a wonderful older sister.

538
00:51:41,330 --> 00:51:46,080
Look, suppose this rumour people are talking about is true,

539
00:51:46,510 --> 00:51:50,380
can you give me a status as your best friend?

540
00:51:50,400 --> 00:51:55,110
Nonsense, Bua! The Master only feels pity for me–that’s why he took me in.

541
00:51:56,930 --> 00:52:01,210
But I don’t think he has ever felt pity for me.

542
00:52:01,750 --> 00:52:04,110
It’s true that he also paid for my education.

543
00:52:04,380 --> 00:52:07,950
But I never get to stay at the main house like you, Miss Phrao.

544
00:52:10,130 --> 00:52:11,780
Look,

545
00:52:12,350 --> 00:52:13,780
why would he be so nice to you if you’re just his worker’s kid?

546
00:52:13,780 --> 00:52:20,380
Trust me, this isn’t normal. There must be more to it than you think.

547
00:52:21,480 --> 00:52:22,380
I’m serious.

548
00:52:58,400 --> 00:53:00,200
I already heard about the rumour.

549
00:53:02,660 --> 00:53:06,610
I went to the fisherman’s wharf and people there were talking.

550
00:53:10,930 --> 00:53:14,450
I really don’t know what to do…

551
00:53:17,700 --> 00:53:19,950
if it turns out that I’m Uncle’s daughter.

552
00:53:22,400 --> 00:53:23,760
You don’t have to do anything.

553
00:53:24,960 --> 00:53:29,480
No matter whose daughter you are, you’re still you.

554
00:53:34,130 --> 00:53:36,260
But even I am this confused.

555
00:53:37,800 --> 00:53:40,110
I can’t imagine how Fai would feel about me.

556
00:53:43,200 --> 00:53:48,310
She has to accept it and try to love you as a sister.

557
00:53:57,060 --> 00:53:58,500
If this is too much for you,

558
00:53:59,930 --> 00:54:01,600
why don’t you come stay with me for a while?

559
00:54:09,930 --> 00:54:13,810
I’m okay. Thanks, Nod.

560
00:54:17,930 --> 00:54:19,660
I always care about you.

561
00:54:23,400 --> 00:54:25,660
You’re the most important person to me.

562
00:54:38,800 --> 00:54:40,550
You might not know it,

563
00:54:41,880 --> 00:54:46,250
but I’ve liked you for a long time since when we were in school.

564
00:54:47,410 --> 00:54:49,380
But I was too afraid to let you know.

565
00:54:57,160 --> 00:54:58,960
But right now, I feel that I should say it.

566
00:55:00,760 --> 00:55:02,600
Because I’m scared I might lose you.

567
00:55:10,800 --> 00:55:12,600
I’ll take care and watch over you.

568
00:55:14,730 --> 00:55:16,760
You don’t have to answer me right now.

569
00:55:19,160 --> 00:55:21,200
I just want you to give me a chance.

570
00:55:22,730 --> 00:55:24,450
Please think about it.

571
00:55:36,130 --> 00:55:38,360
I’m always here for you.

572
00:56:32,850 --> 00:56:34,410
Hey, hey, listen.

573
00:56:34,410 --> 00:56:35,350
I think…

574
00:56:38,460 --> 00:56:39,680
Hello, Miss.

575
00:56:46,360 --> 00:56:47,160
What is it?

576
00:56:47,460 --> 00:56:51,410
I think Kaphrao is definitely the Master's secret daughter.

577
00:56:51,660 --> 00:56:55,300
I knew it! That’s why Miss Panee hates her so much.

578
00:56:55,530 --> 00:56:56,130
That's it.

579
00:56:56,130 --> 00:56:59,980
She’s probably afraid that girl will steal everything from Young Master.

580
00:57:00,260 --> 00:57:04,980
I also heard that the Master was quite a player back then.

581
00:57:05,130 --> 00:57:05,760
Really?

582
00:57:05,760 --> 00:57:09,310
Yes, so many girls to warm his bed–old and young.

583
00:57:09,360 --> 00:57:10,160
Really?

584
00:57:10,200 --> 00:57:10,960
Mhm.

585
00:57:12,080 --> 00:57:16,660
Come to think of it, there used to be a rumour that he liked to flirt around.

586
00:57:17,700 --> 00:57:19,480
Yeah, I guess it's all true.

587
00:57:26,200 --> 00:57:29,400
Kaphrao is definitely the Master's secret daughter.

588
00:57:30,000 --> 00:57:33,750
She’s afraid that girl will steal everything from Young Master.

589
00:57:40,860 --> 00:57:44,210
[Akanee]: Kaphrao will live with us. From now on, she’s your sister.

590
00:57:44,550 --> 00:57:46,310
You must look after her.

591
00:57:46,310 --> 00:57:48,080
Why do you always pick on her?

592
00:57:48,500 --> 00:57:51,310
[Panee]: What if she’s the kid of your father’s mistress?

593
00:57:51,310 --> 00:57:55,680
[Akanee]: Kaphrao has graduated. I want her to help me with my work here.

594
00:57:55,680 --> 00:57:58,880
You should take her with you to Nam’s grand opening.

595
00:57:58,900 --> 00:58:01,480
Show her around

596
00:58:01,480 --> 00:58:04,210
and introduce her to your siblings.

597
00:58:15,500 --> 00:58:17,360
Are we really sisters?

598
00:59:07,300 --> 00:59:10,610
There’s a rumour spreading among the workers that Kaphrao is your daughter.

599
00:59:12,100 --> 00:59:15,110
Last time, they said she was my kept woman.

600
00:59:16,000 --> 00:59:17,280
And now, she’s my daughter?

601
00:59:19,160 --> 00:59:20,760
But I can see why they think that.

602
00:59:23,730 --> 00:59:26,980
I’m deeply indebted to Kaphrao’s father.

603
00:59:28,560 --> 00:59:32,060
Hey, don’t tell me you also believe this rumour.

604
00:59:35,300 --> 00:59:37,080
That’s not funny.

605
00:59:37,300 --> 00:59:41,350
What if Miss Panee hears about it? Kaphrao would surely be in trouble.

606
00:59:48,060 --> 00:59:48,860
You’re right.

607
01:00:03,160 --> 01:00:06,480
Aww, Miss Phrao, you’re so diligent.

608
01:00:12,600 --> 01:00:13,980
Just as I thought!

609
01:00:14,360 --> 01:00:16,580
You’re a complete wreck to Fai’s life.

610
01:00:16,860 --> 01:00:18,980
You’re stealing everything from her!

611
01:00:19,080 --> 01:00:22,580
That cave incident, Fai almost couldn’t get out of there alive.

612
01:00:22,900 --> 01:00:24,500
All because of you, you damn jinx!

613
01:00:27,000 --> 01:00:32,210
You made her lie to me and put her in danger.

614
01:00:32,760 --> 01:00:34,510
Get the hell out of Akanee Group!

615
01:00:34,860 --> 01:00:36,210
Get out of her life right now!

616
01:00:36,210 --> 01:00:38,350
Aunt Nee, that’s enough!

617
01:00:38,560 --> 01:00:40,210
Stop talking to her like that!

618
01:00:41,260 --> 01:00:42,960
You still try to defend her?

619
01:00:43,960 --> 01:00:46,550
She’s going to steal everything from you!

620
01:00:46,600 --> 01:00:48,580
She almost got you killed!

621
01:00:51,100 --> 01:00:52,950
Kaphrao is under my care.

622
01:00:53,200 --> 01:00:55,180
Just blame it on me.

623
01:00:55,660 --> 01:00:56,960
How can you say that?

624
01:00:57,400 --> 01:00:58,460
Enough, Panee!

625
01:01:01,960 --> 01:01:02,930
Ak.

626
01:01:03,600 --> 01:01:08,680
Look at her. Your daughter is trying to protect your mistress’s kid.

627
01:01:12,730 --> 01:01:14,910
Kaphrao isn’t my mistress’s kid.

628
01:01:14,930 --> 01:01:16,950
And you don’t have the right to talk to her like that!

629
01:01:16,950 --> 01:01:18,480
Then what is she?

630
01:01:18,700 --> 01:01:21,980
Why the hell would you tell her to move into the main house?

631
01:01:22,760 --> 01:01:25,280
She’s the daughter of someone I’m indebted to.

632
01:01:25,960 --> 01:01:27,950
Her father saved my life.

633
01:01:43,260 --> 01:01:44,580
[Akanee]: I’m not afraid.

634
01:01:44,800 --> 01:01:48,510
I’ve won this auction for mining lease legally.

635
01:01:48,860 --> 01:01:50,750
I don’t care if anyone doesn’t want to play by the rules.

636
01:01:53,660 --> 01:01:54,810
[Arthit]: Look out, Master!

637
01:01:55,930 --> 01:01:57,200
Let’s go!

638
01:02:02,860 --> 01:02:03,660
This way!

639
01:02:18,130 --> 01:02:18,930
Arthit!

640
01:02:31,760 --> 01:02:32,880
Master, look out!

641
01:02:47,260 --> 01:02:48,060
Arthit!

642
01:02:50,300 --> 01:02:51,530
Are you all right, Master?

643
01:02:53,530 --> 01:02:57,410
Please look after my daughter.

644
01:02:58,730 --> 01:02:59,530
Arthit.

645
01:03:01,060 --> 01:03:01,860
Arthit!

646
01:03:02,560 --> 01:03:03,360
Arthit!

647
01:03:07,330 --> 01:03:08,350
Arthit!

648
01:03:10,800 --> 01:03:13,810
Her father saved my life so many times

649
01:03:13,900 --> 01:03:16,510
from those powerful thugs whom I got in their way.

650
01:03:18,930 --> 01:03:20,410
But in the end,

651
01:03:21,880 --> 01:03:24,010
her father died because of me.

652
01:03:37,560 --> 01:03:38,700
He sacrificed his life for me.

653
01:03:42,860 --> 01:03:43,660
Liar!

654
01:03:45,700 --> 01:03:46,800
I don’t believe you!

655
01:03:47,060 --> 01:03:50,110
You made that up just to protect this girl!

656
01:03:50,560 --> 01:03:56,610
Do you really want me to believe that a stupid worker like that would sacrifice his life for you?

657
01:03:56,950 --> 01:03:58,210
Liar!

658
01:03:58,330 --> 01:04:01,780
Watch it, Panee! You should have some respect for others!

659
01:04:02,460 --> 01:04:08,110
I order everyone here to never talk about this again!

660
01:04:12,330 --> 01:04:13,530
You’re a nasty bitch!

661
01:04:14,980 --> 01:04:18,950
A good-for-nothing! You're ruining Fai’s life!

662
01:04:19,650 --> 01:04:20,380
Aunt Nee!

663
01:04:20,380 --> 01:04:21,380
- Yod!
- Please stop!

664
01:04:21,380 --> 01:04:22,410
- Yod!
- Please stop!

665
01:04:23,150 --> 01:04:23,850
Stop!

666
01:04:23,850 --> 01:04:25,080
- Miss Panee!
- Aunt Nee!

667
01:04:25,080 --> 01:04:27,710
Please stop it! Stop!

668
01:04:27,710 --> 01:04:29,150
You nasty bitch!

669
01:04:29,150 --> 01:04:30,710
Please don’t!

670
01:04:32,760 --> 01:04:33,560
Get off me!

671
01:04:36,130 --> 01:04:38,850
You scumbag! Get back here!

672
01:05:43,660 --> 01:05:45,180
How is Kaphrao?

673
01:05:50,730 --> 01:05:52,100
She still hasn’t said anything.

674
01:05:54,000 --> 01:05:55,980
So, where are you taking her?

675
01:06:00,760 --> 01:06:03,350
Maybe somewhere to get our heads straight first.

676
01:06:03,500 --> 01:06:05,130
I don’t want her to see Aunt Nee.

677
01:06:05,850 --> 01:06:10,310
Good, better wait for it to die down before coming back.

678
01:06:11,600 --> 01:06:13,380
Look after her for me.

679
01:06:16,500 --> 01:06:17,510
I will.

680
01:06:30,100 --> 01:06:31,480
Drink something first.

681
01:06:38,900 --> 01:06:41,910
I’ve always believed my dad died in an accident.

682
01:06:45,000 --> 01:06:47,800
Now, I know…why Uncle is so nice to me.

683
01:06:50,910 --> 01:06:54,310
Are you mad at my dad?

684
01:07:00,860 --> 01:07:02,280
No, I don’t blame him.

685
01:07:03,480 --> 01:07:07,580
And I’m proud of what my dad did.

686
01:07:15,930 --> 01:07:17,450
I’m sorry.

687
01:07:19,330 --> 01:07:21,780
Your dad did all he could to protect my dad.

688
01:07:23,360 --> 01:07:29,450
But I still let Aunt Nee hurt you. I couldn’t protect you at all.

689
01:07:34,400 --> 01:07:36,710
You did protect me today.

690
01:07:37,800 --> 01:07:39,050
Thank you.

691
01:07:49,380 --> 01:07:52,750
So, where are we going?

692
01:07:56,160 --> 01:08:00,380
Somewhere to take refuge—away from all this madness.

693
01:08:00,910 --> 01:08:03,280
We’ll come back when things get better.

694
01:08:53,700 --> 01:08:55,899
[Next Episode]
Please don’t go see that nasty girl again, dear.

695
01:08:56,330 --> 01:08:58,160
You also hate her to your guts, don’t you?

696
01:08:58,529 --> 01:09:00,850
And I hate you so much too!

697
01:09:00,859 --> 01:09:01,660
Phrao!

698
01:09:02,300 --> 01:09:04,050
Give her some time.

699
01:09:04,359 --> 01:09:06,460
She’ll come out when she feels better.

700
01:09:06,660 --> 01:09:08,450
Hurry up and say it.

701
01:09:08,700 --> 01:09:10,100
I actually don’t hate you.

702
01:09:10,260 --> 01:09:11,760
Then, how do you feel about me?

703
01:09:12,180 --> 01:09:13,080
I…

704
01:09:13,080 --> 01:09:15,810
Forget it. I don’t want to know anymore.

705
01:09:16,760 --> 01:09:17,930
Kaphrao! Hold on!

706
01:09:18,100 --> 01:09:23,609
If I were kind like you, calm like Nam, and sweet like Lom–

707
01:09:23,859 --> 01:09:26,149
she might have liked me more.

708
01:09:26,660 --> 01:09:29,649
I’m sure she’ll like you the way you are.

709
01:09:48,479 --> 01:09:55,510
♫I still remember vividly that day when we first met♫

710
01:09:56,080 --> 01:10:01,850
♫Those memories we had together never fade away from my heart♫

711
01:10:02,210 --> 01:10:09,810
♫We might never say it out loud how we feel for each other♫

712
01:10:09,810 --> 01:10:15,580
♫But deep down we both know how we feel♫

713
01:10:15,580 --> 01:10:21,710
♫Those things in the past, I still can’t forget them♫

714
01:10:21,710 --> 01:10:27,810
♫I want to know if you’re like that too–do you also feel the same?♫

715
01:10:28,210 --> 01:10:35,780
♫I could never forget those eyes of yours♫

716
01:10:35,780 --> 01:10:42,210
♫The warmth you used to give me, I still remember it vividly♫

717
01:10:42,510 --> 01:10:49,580
♫No matter for how long, you’ll always remain in my heart♫

718
01:10:49,580 --> 01:10:59,980
♫All those years I’ve been waiting, for us to finally be together again♫

719
01:11:08,010 --> 01:11:11,910
[North Star Entertainment]

720
01:11:11,910 --> 01:11:15,910
[Flaming Chains of Love]
